  ✓ detect_version_divergence — matches vector clock conflict detection
  ✓ rank_peer_versions — matches Dynamo sloppy quorum
  ✓ resolve_version_conflict — matches Git merge / collaborative editing
  ✓ broadcast_resolved_version — matches gossip protocol

  RESULT: 12/12 ALIGNMENT PASS ✓

Gate 2 (Clarity):
  ✓ All 12 operations have unique symbolic names (⊙:operation_name)
  ✓ All inputs/outputs clearly defined with types
  ✓ All state transitions explicit (before → after)
  ✓ All strategies are exclusive sets (full|delta|merkle, last-write-wins|CRDT|OT)
