  ✓ No ambiguous operations
  ✓ All operations mutually exclusive

  RESULT: 12/12 CLARITY PASS ✓

Gate 3 (Visibility):
  ✓ TIER 1 operations: No ledger (cached connectivity state)
  ✓ TIER 2 operations: No ledger (cached replication/sync decisions)
  ✓ TIER 3 operations: Create/append to ledger_* (conflicts, events, consensus)
